<title>USA: Guest Supply to buy back up to 5 pct of shrs.</title>
<headline>Guest Supply to buy back up to 5 pct of shrs.</headline>
<dateline>MONMOUTH JUNCTION, N.J. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guest Supply Inc said Monday it will buy back up to five percent of its outstanding common stock in the open market or private transactions, subject to market price and other considerations.</p>
<p>The company said the shares will be used for its employee incentive and benefit plans.</p>
<p>Guest Supply provides personal care amenities and other operating supplies to the lodging industry and makes health</p>
<p>and beauty products for consumer products companies and retailers.</p>
</text>
